ss=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n                <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n                <p><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n                <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n                <p>☆☆☆☆☆</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>解説</h3>\n                <p>現在調査中です。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">スペック</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>AT確率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:60%;\">AT初当り</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/366.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/358.6</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/345.4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/308.3</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/282.8</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/270.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:60%;\">出玉率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>98.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>100.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>105.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>110.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>113.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>記載</th>\n                        </tr><tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">天井情報\n                            </td>\n                            <td>ゲーム数天井<br>WAVE数天井</td>\n                      